# Spacing tokens

This project overrides Tailwind spacing in `app/globals.css`. `h-9`, `p-8`, `gap-7`, and similar utilities are **not** the default Tailwind sizes.

| Token | This project | Default Tailwind |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `1` | 4px | 4px |
| `2` | 8px | 8px |
| `3` | 12px | 12px |
| `4` | 16px | 16px |
| `5` | 24px | 20px |
| `6` | 32px | 24px |
| `7` | 48px | 28px |
| `8` | 64px | 32px |
| `9` | 96px | 36px |

Control heights match `Button`: `sm` is `h-5` (24px), `md` is `h-6` (32px). Never use `h-9` for a tab, button, or input. That is 96px here.

```tsx
// BAD: default Tailwind muscle memory (36px there, 96px here)
<Tabs.Tab className="h-9 px-3" />

// GOOD: same height as Button md
<Tabs.Tab className="h-6 px-3" />
```
